--- !u!114 &1650505192
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1650505190}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Sunlight.

    Actual, honest-to-gods sunlight. You''d forgotten what
    it looked like.


    You stumble out coughing, squinting, alive. The venom''s
    still in your blood. Your legs feel like wet rope. And somewhere deep in your
    brain, a little voice now screams every time it sees something longer than a
    stick.


    That''s new. That one''s going to be fun at parties.

    Caves?
    Tunnels? Crawlspaces? Hard pass. Forever. You didn''t have claustrophobia before
    today, you''ve earned it now.


    But here''s the thing: you''re breathing.
    Above ground. Sky above you instead of a thousand tons of cursed stone.


    The
    plan is simple. Get to the coast. Find that old ship. Sail away, no crew, no
    map, no plan. Sleep on deck because the cabin is a bit tight. And dark. And enclosed.
    And absolutely not happening.


    You''re alive, old crow. Now go do your thing
    and don''t forget to live every now and then.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0b9bc487b9b6cac4583801b20e77a751, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 6049873288185909572, guid: 0b9bc487b9b6cac4583801b20e77a751, type: 2}
